<!-- ============ START SCREEN ============ -->
<div id="startScreen">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">Free Practice Test</span>
      <h1>APTET Paper&#8209;II Full Practice Test</h1>
      <p class="sub">Based on the actual APTET Questions from Previous Question Papers, Mathematics &amp; Science : Content and method. All 150 questions, bilingual (English + Telugu), exactly as they appeared as in the exam.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-row">
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">150</div><div class="lbl">Total Questions</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">6</div><div class="lbl">Subjects</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">150</div><div class="lbl">Marks</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">Live</div><div class="lbl">Instant Feedback</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="subject-strip">
      <h3>Subjects covered</h3>
      <div class="subject-grid" id="subjectStripGrid"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="start-form">
      <label for="nameInput">Enter your name (for certificate &amp; leaderboard)</label>
      <input type="text" id="nameInput" placeholder="e.g. K. Suresh Kumar" maxlength="60" autocomplete="off">
      <div class="err-msg" id="nameErr">Please enter your name to start the test.</div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" id="startBtn">Start Mock Test &rarr;</button>
      <div class="hint" style="text-align:center;margin-top:12px;">Your responses stay in this browser. Only your name &amp; final score are sent to the live leaderboard.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="rules">
      <h4>How this mock test works</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>All 150 questions are shown one at a time, in exam order: Child Development &amp; Pedagogy (30) &rarr; Telugu (30) &rarr; English (30) &rarr; Mathematics (20) &rarr; Physical Science (20) &rarr; Biological Science (20).</li>
        <li>Use the subject buttons at the top, or the question palette on the right, to jump to any question or subject at any time.</li>
        <li>As soon as you choose an option, you'll instantly see if it's correct (green) or wrong (red) &mdash; the correct answer is always revealed. Once answered, that question is locked.</li>
        <li>Your live score updates on top as you go. Answered questions turn <b style="color:var(--blue)">blue</b> and skipped questions turn <b style="color:var(--yellow)">yellow</b> on the palette.</li>
        <li>At the end, you'll get your full score report, subject-wise breakdown, a downloadable Certificate of Appreciation, the complete answer key with your responses, and the live leaderboard.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-credit">
